<section class="phero"><div class="phero-bg"><img src="/assets/img/photos/roofer.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/roofer-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/roofer.webp 1024w" sizes="100vw" width="1024" height="765" alt="" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" data-parallax="0.15"></div><div class="wrap phero-in"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><i aria-hidden="true">›</i><span aria-current="page">Services</span></nav><p class="kicker">What we handle</p><h1>Kansas Insurance Appraisal Services</h1><p class="lede">From a single estimate review to full panel representation and neutral umpire work, every service is built around an accurate, defensible valuation of your Kansas property loss.</p><div class="btn-row"><a class="btn btn-gold" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg> Call (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn btn-line" href="/request-kansas-claim-review/">Free claim review</a></div></div></section>
<section class="sec"><div class="wrap"><div class="igrid" data-stagger><a class="icard rv" href="/what-we-handle/appointed-appraiser-representation/"><span class="icard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/consultation.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/consultation-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/consultation.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1024" height="734" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>Service 01</small><h2>Appraisal Clause Representation</h2><p>We act as the appraiser you name when the appraisal provision in your policy is invoked.</p></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/what-we-handle/home-insurance-appraisal/"><span class="icard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/ranch-home.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/ranch-home-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/ranch-home.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1024" height="683" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>Service 02</small><h2>Homeowner Claim Appraisal</h2><p>Houses, townhomes and condo units where the carrier’s estimate leaves out real repair costs.</p></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/what-we-handle/commercial-hoa-appraisal/"><span class="icard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/commercial-roof.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/commercial-roof-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/commercial-roof.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1024" height="768" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>Service 03</small><h2>Commercial &amp; HOA Claim Appraisal</h2><p>Retail, office, warehouse, multifamily, church and association properties with complex losses.</p></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/what-we-handle/hail-roof-appraisal/"><span class="icard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/hail-roof.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/hail-roof-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/hail-roof.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1024" height="683" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>Service 04</small><h2>Roof &amp; Hail Damage Appraisal</h2><p>Hail is the Kansas claim. We document every slope, vent, gutter and screen the storm touched.</p></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/what-we-handle/tornado-wind-appraisal/"><span class="icard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/tornado.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/tornado-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/tornado.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1024" height="676" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>Service 05</small><h2>Tornado &amp; Straight-Line Wind Appraisal</h2><p>Tornado, derecho and straight-line wind losses, from lifted shingles to total destruction.</p></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/what-we-handle/ice-storm-freeze-appraisal/"><span class="icard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/ice-storm.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/ice-storm-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/ice-storm.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1024" height="627" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>Service 06</small><h2>Ice Storm &amp; Freeze Damage Appraisal</h2><p>Ice-loaded limbs, collapsed gutters, ice dams and burst pipes after a hard Kansas freeze.</p></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/what-we-handle/water-damage-appraisal/"><span class="icard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/water-ceiling.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/water-ceiling-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/water-ceiling.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1024" height="768" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>Service 07</small><h2>Water Damage Appraisal</h2><p>Sudden leaks, supply-line failures, roof leaks and sewer backups with incomplete scopes.</p></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/what-we-handle/fire-smoke-appraisal/"><span class="icard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/house-fire.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/house-fire-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/house-fire.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1024" height="683" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>Service 08</small><h2>Fire &amp; Smoke Damage Appraisal</h2><p>Structure fires, smoke and soot migration, and the contents inventories that follow.</p></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/what-we-handle/wildfire-grass-fire-appraisal/"><span class="icard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/grass-fire.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/grass-fire-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/grass-fire.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1024" height="626" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>Service 09</small><h2>Wildfire &amp; Grass Fire Appraisal</h2><p>Wind-driven prairie fires that burn homes, fences, barns and equipment sheds across rural Kansas.</p></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/what-we-handle/farm-ranch-building-appraisal/"><span class="icard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/metal-barn.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/metal-barn-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/metal-barn.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1024" height="939" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>Service 10</small><h2>Farm &amp; Ranch Building Appraisal</h2><p>Pole barns, machine sheds, grain bins, shops and farmhouses insured under farm policies.</p></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/what-we-handle/claim-estimate-review/"><span class="icard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/estimate-review.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/estimate-review-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/estimate-review.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="960" height="640" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>Service 11</small><h2>Claim Estimate Review</h2><p>A line-by-line review of the carrier’s estimate that shows exactly what was missed and what it is worth.</p></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/what-we-handle/appraisal-umpire-services/"><span class="icard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/documents.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/documents-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/documents.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="960" height="640" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>Service 12</small><h2>Umpire Services</h2><p>Neutral umpire work for Kansas appraisal panels where the two appraisers can’t agree.</p></span></a></div></div></section>
<section class="sec sec-sky"><div class="wrap split split-top"><div class="rv"><p class="kicker">Not sure where to start?</p><h2>Most claims start with an estimate review</h2><p>Before anyone demands appraisal, it helps to know exactly where the insurer’s estimate falls short and what that is worth. A review answers that in days, and many disputes close right there.</p><a class="btn btn-navy" href="/what-we-handle/claim-estimate-review/">About estimate reviews <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></div><div class="rv"><div class="faq"><details><summary><span>Can I hire you for one part of the process?</span><svg class="pl" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></summary><div class="a"><p>Yes. Many clients start with an estimate review and decide later whether to demand appraisal.</p></div></details><details><summary><span>Do you handle farm and commercial claims?</span><svg class="pl" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></summary><div class="a"><p>Yes: homes, condos, farms and ranches, retail, office, warehouse, churches and HOA communities.</p></div></details><details><summary><span>Is it only hail?</span><svg class="pl" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></summary><div class="a"><p>No. We handle tornado, wind, ice, water, fire and grass fire losses too.</p></div></details></div></div></div></section>
<section class="cta-strip"><div class="wrap cta-strip-in rv"><div><h2>Numbers on your claim don’t add up?</h2><p>Send the insurer’s estimate. We’ll read it line by line and tell you what we see.</p></div><div class="btn-row"><a class="btn btn-gold" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg> (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn btn-line" href="/request-kansas-claim-review/">Email the estimate</a></div></div></section>
